**/node_modules
**/dist
**/build
# Build state outside dist/ would let `tsc -b` skip projects whose dist/ was
# ignored here, compiling against types that were never emitted.
**/*.tsbuildinfo
backend/public
.git
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
# Local-only planning docs (gitignored, so CI's context never has them — without
# these lines a local `docker build` format-checks files CI cannot see).
CLAUDE.md
AGENTS.md
TEMPLATE.md
docs
.claude
data
*.sqlite
*.sqlite-shm
*.sqlite-wal
# The Capacitor shell is built on the host by scripts/release-android.sh, never in the image.
apps/android
# Verification artifacts never enter a production image.
test-results
playwright-report
